---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of use for the Repose website and app."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <header class="reveal mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-black sm:text-5xl">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-repose-muted">Effective 2026-08-09</p>
    </header>

    <div class="reveal space-y-10 text-base leading-relaxed text-repose-muted">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-repose-text">App usage terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Use of the Repose app itself is governed by Apple's Standard
          End User License Agreement (EULA), which applies by default to
          all apps distributed through the App Store. You can read it at{" "}
          <a
            href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-repose-text underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80"
          >
            apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-repose-text">Website terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          These terms apply specifically to your use of this website
          (reposesleep.net), separate from the app itself.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>
            All content on this site — text, design, and the Repose name and
            logo — belongs to Solace Studios unless otherwise noted, and may
            not be reproduced without permission.
          </li>
          <li>
            This site is provided "as is," without warranties of any kind. We
            make a reasonable effort to keep it accurate and available, but
            don't guarantee uninterrupted access.
          </li>
          <li>
            Solace Studios is not liable for any damages arising from your use
            of this website, to the extent permitted by law.
          </li>
          <li>
            These terms are governed by the laws of the United States, without
            regard to conflict-of-law principles.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-repose-text">Changes</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          These terms may be updated from time to time. Continued use of the
          site after changes are posted means you accept the updated terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-repose-text">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Questions about these terms can be sent to{" "}
          <a
            href="mailto:SolaceStudioDevs@protonmail.com"
            class="text-repose-text underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80"
          >
            SolaceStudioDevs@protonmail.com
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
